   1:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** /**
   2:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @file    stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c
   4:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @brief   FLASH HAL module driver.
   6:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          functionalities of the internal FLASH memory:
   8:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Program operations functions
   9:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Memory Control functions
  10:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Peripheral Errors functions
  11:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *
  12:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   @verbatim
  13:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****                         ##### FLASH peripheral features #####
  15:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  16:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  17:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface manages CPU AHB I-Code and D-Code accesses
  18:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        to the Flash memory. It implements the erase and program Flash memory operations
  19:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        and the read and write protection mechanisms.
  20:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  21:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface accelerates code execution with a system of instruction
  22:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        prefetch and cache lines.
  23:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  24:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The FLASH main features are:
  25:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory read operations
  26:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory program/erase operations
  27:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Read / write protections
  28:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Option bytes programming
  29:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Prefetch on I-Code
  30:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 32 cache lines of 4*64 or 2*128 bits on I-Code
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccOQHGH1.s 			page 2


  31:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 8 cache lines of 4*64 or 2*128 bits on D-Code
  32:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Error code correction (ECC) : Data in flash are 72-bits word
  33:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****           (8 bits added per double word)
  34:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  35:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  36:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  37:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  38:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]
  39:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       This driver provides functions and macros to configure and program the FLASH
  40:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       memory of all STM32G4xx devices.
  41:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  42:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Flash Memory IO Programming functions:
  43:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and
  44:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
  45:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Program functions: double word and fast program (full row programming)
  46:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) There are two modes of programming :
  47:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Polling mode using HAL_FLASH_Program() function
  48:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Interrupt mode using HAL_FLASH_Program_IT() function
  49:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  50:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Interrupts and flags management functions:
  51:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Handle FLASH interrupts by calling HAL_FLASH_IRQHandler()
  52:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Callback functions are called when the flash operations are finished :
  53:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_EndOfOperationCallback() when everything is ok, otherwise
  54:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_OperationErrorCallback()
  55:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Get error flag status by calling HAL_GetError()
  56:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  57:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Option bytes management functions:
  58:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the option bytes using HAL_FLASH_OB_Unlock() and
  59:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_OB_Lock() functions
  60:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Launch the reload of the option bytes using HAL_FLASH_Launch() function.
  61:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****                 In this case, a reset is generated
  62:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  63:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]
  64:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       In addition to these functions, this driver includes a set of macros allowing
  65:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****       to handle the following operations:
  66:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Set the latency
  67:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the prefetch buffer
  68:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the Instruction cache and the Data cache
  69:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Reset the Instruction cache and the Data cache
  70:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the Flash power-down during low-power run and sleep modes
  71:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the Flash interrupts
  72:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Monitor the Flash flags status
  73:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  74:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   @endverbatim
  75:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ******************************************************************************
